        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="Source: maps.routes.js, location-search.service.js, pet-care.routes.js and pet-care-management.service.js. LocationSearchService never writes address records. Provider/technical failure remains separate from owner-confirmed save. Existing Google adapter is optional; selected production provider is Vietmap. Private notes are not sent to search provider." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
